# Implementation Plan - Full-Stack Dynamic Portfolio with Admin CMS & PDF Export Engine

Upgrade the portfolio repository into a production-grade full-stack web application featuring JWT admin authentication, protected CMS REST APIs, experience & asset/certificate management, dynamic PDF resume export engine with 2 distinct templates, and remote repository syncing.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Default Admin Credentials**: A seed script will create an initial admin user (`admin` / `admin123456`) which can be updated via the `/admin` portal or `.env` variable `ADMIN_PASSWORD`.
> - **Target Repository**: The final code will be committed and pushed to `https://github.com/priyanshu-sarjan/Priyanshu_Portfolio.git` on the `main` branch.

